[{"label":"In / out, directions and lifecycle","html":"<style>\n  #anim-skew-target {\n    width: 160px;\n    height: 100px;\n    display: grid;\n    place-items: center;\n    border: 1px solid var(--border);\n    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n    background: var(--card);\n    color: var(--card-foreground);\n    font-weight: 600;\n  }\n  #anim-skew-demo button[data-dir][aria-pressed='true'] {\n    background: var(--accent);\n    color: var(--accent-foreground);\n  }\n</style>\n<div id=\"anim-skew-demo\" style=\"display: grid; gap: 0.75rem; justify-items: start\">\n  <div id=\"anim-skew-target\">skew me</div>\n  <div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.4rem\">\n    <button class=\"btn\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-size=\"sm\" id=\"anim-skew-in\">In</button>\n    <button class=\"btn\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-size=\"sm\" id=\"anim-skew-out\">Out</button>\n    <button class=\"btn\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-size=\"sm\" data-dir=\"north\" aria-pressed=\"false\">N</button>\n    <button class=\"btn\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-size=\"sm\" data-dir=\"south\" aria-pressed=\"false\">S</button>\n    <button class=\"btn\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-size=\"sm\" data-dir=\"west\" aria-pressed=\"true\">W</button>\n    <button class=\"btn\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-size=\"sm\" data-dir=\"east\" aria-pressed=\"false\">E</button>\n    <button class=\"btn\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-size=\"sm\" id=\"anim-skew-pause\">Pause</button>\n    <button class=\"btn\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-size=\"sm\" id=\"anim-skew-resume\">Resume</button>\n    <button class=\"btn\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-size=\"sm\" id=\"anim-skew-finish\">Finish</button>\n    <button class=\"btn\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-size=\"sm\" id=\"anim-skew-reset\">Reset</button>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; flex-wrap: wrap\">\n    <label class=\"label\" for=\"anim-skew-duration\">Duration</label>\n    <input class=\"input\" id=\"anim-skew-duration\" type=\"number\" min=\"50\" step=\"50\" value=\"1500\" style=\"width: 6rem\" />\n    <label class=\"label\" for=\"anim-skew-easing\">Easing</label>\n    <select class=\"select\" id=\"anim-skew-easing\">\n      <option value=\"cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1)\" selected>ease-out (default)</option>\n      <option value=\"ease\">ease</option>\n      <option value=\"ease-in-out\">ease-in-out</option>\n      <option value=\"linear\">linear</option>\n      <option value=\"cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1)\">spring</option>\n    </select>\n  </div>\n</div>\n","individual":false},{"label":"Scroll-bound skew","html":"<div\n  id=\"anim-skew-stage\"\n  style=\"\n    height: 220px;\n    overflow-y: auto;\n    border: 1px solid var(--border);\n    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n    padding: 1rem;\n  \"\n>\n  <div style=\"height: 600px; display: grid; align-content: space-between; justify-items: center\">\n    <div\n      id=\"anim-skew-scroll-target\"\n      style=\"\n        width: 160px;\n        height: 100px;\n        display: grid;\n        place-items: center;\n        border: 1px solid var(--border);\n        border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n        background: var(--card);\n        color: var(--card-foreground);\n        font-weight: 600;\n      \"\n      >scroll-driven</div\n    >\n    <p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\" style=\"margin: 0\">end of the scroll range - fully un-skewed</p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<button class=\"btn\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-size=\"sm\" id=\"anim-skew-scroll-reset\" style=\"margin-top: 0.5rem\"\n  >Reset</button\n>\n","individual":false}]
